      "text": "To solve the given expression \\(\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i} + \\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i}\\), we will first simplify each fraction separately and then add the results together.\n\n### Step 1: Simplify \\(\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i}\\)\n\nTo simplify \\(\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i}\\), we multiply the numerator and the denominator by the complex conjugate of the denominator. The complex conjugate of \\(3 - 5i\\) is \\(3 + 5i\\).\n\n\\[\n\\frac{3 + 5i}{3 - 5i} \\cdot \\frac{3 + 5i}{3 + 5i} = \\frac{(3 + 5i)(3 + 5i)}{(3 - 5i)(3 + 5i)}\n\\]\n\nFirst, compute the denominator:\n\n\\[\n(3 - 5i)(3 + 5i) = 3^2 - (5i)^2 = 9 - 25i^2 = 9 - 25(-1) = 9 + 25 = 34\n\\]\n\nNext, compute the numerator:\n\n\\[\n(3 + 5i)(3 + 5i) = 3^2 + 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5i + (5i)^2 = 9 + 30i + 25i^2 = 9 + 30i + 25(-1) = 9 + 30i - 25 = -16 + 30i\n\\]\n\nSo, the fraction becomes:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{-16 + 30i}{34} = \\frac{-16}{34} + \\frac{30i}{34} = -\\frac{8}{17} + \\frac{15i}{17}\n\\]\n\n### Step 2: Simplify \\(\\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i}\\)\n\nSimilarly, for \\(\\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i}\\), we multiply the numerator and the denominator by the complex conjugate of the denominator, which is \\(3 - 5i\\).\n\n\\[\n\\frac{3 - 5i}{3 + 5i} \\cdot \\frac{3 - 5i}{3 - 5i} = \\frac{(3 - 5i)(3 - 5i)}{(3 + 5i)(3 - 5i)}\n\\]\n\nFirst, compute the denominator:\n\n\\[\n(3 + 5i)(3 - 5i) = 3^2 - (5i)^2 = 9 - 25i^2 = 9 - 25(-1) = 9 + 25 = 34\n\\]\n\nNext, compute the numerator:\n\n\\[\n(3 - 5i)(3 - 5i) = 3^2 - 2 \\cdot 3 \\cdot 5i + (5i)^2 = 9 - 30i + 25i^2 = 9 - 30i + 25(-1) = 9 - 30i - 25 = -16 - 30i\n\\]\n\nSo, the fraction becomes:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{-16 - 30i}{34} = -\\frac{16}{34} - \\frac{30i}{34} = -\\frac{8}{17} - \\frac{15i}{17}\n\\]\n\n### Step 3: Add the simplified fractions\n\nNow, we add the two simplified fractions:\n\n\\[\n-\\frac{8}{17} + \\frac{15i}{17} + \\left(-\\frac{8}{17} - \\frac{15i}{17}\\right) = \\left(-\\frac{8}{17} - \\frac{8}{17}\\right) + \\left(\\frac{15i}{17} - \\frac{15i}{17}\\right) = -\\frac{16}{17} + 0i = -\\frac{16}{17}\n\\]\n\nThus, the final answer is:\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{-\\frac{16}{17}}\n\\]",
